@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": minor
+---
+
+Persist authenticated received commands, immutable source snapshots and receive events in one transaction before writing the official profile. Register consumers at an immutable first-use receive boundary so retained historical batches are not treated as new requests after upgrades or restarts. Keep unsupported commands and identity conflicts visible for review after event acknowledgement, and record incoming recalls before admitting a quote of the target.
+
+The receive journal is an operational receipt store, separate from the official archive. Its raw batches and snapshots are retained without automatic pruning; deployments must monitor disk usage. Official profile writes run one command per account-gate acquisition, allowing received-message reads and queued sends to proceed between writes.
